%---------------- ISPF Tutorial 1 of 5: The Dialog -----------------------%
%Command ===>_ZCMD
+
 ULS is a REXX exec driven by ISPF services. The exec opens a catalog
 list, displays a panel, processes a command, and redisplays the panel.
+
 The list is limited by the catalog level entered on the main panel.
 For example, SYS1 lists entries under SYS1; YOURID.PROJ narrows it
 further. The level is not a wildcard expression.
+
 The name must be unquoted and no longer than 44 characters. The scroll
 field accepts a number, PAGE, or CSR.
+
 Use FILTER to reduce the returned names without another catalog scan.
 REFRESH repeats the catalog scan after catalog contents change.
+
 Enter NEXT, PREV, 2-5, or END to navigate these tutorial pages.
)END
